# Decide Local Storage Backend

Choose v1 persistence for the context plane on the configured host: SQLite/libsql, plain JSONL + side index, or Typesense (link-ingest precedent). Must satisfy &lt;2s search for brain + X receipts at v1 scale.

## Step

Grill Joel on tradeoffs with schema asset in hand. Resolved when backend choice + directory layout + migration story are recorded.
